STAGE-3 GATE RULE
-----------------
A patient may receive a final PASS/GO designation only when the required
execution evidence for that stage is present and traceable.

The following cannot independently establish PASS/GO:
    - A manuscript table
    - A manually reconstructed value
    - An expected range
    - A figure generated from summary values
    - A parameter specification without the executed model
    - A statement that a simulation "passed" without its corresponding log
      or artifact

